flowchart TD
    A[Attacker registers malicious OAuth app] --> B[Sends consent link disguised as legitimate]
    B --> C[User clicks link and signs in normally]
    C --> D[User grants consent to app permissions]
    D --> E[App receives refresh token]
    E --> F[Refresh token grants persistent access]
    F --> G[Attacker accesses mail, files, and data]
    G --> H[Access continues without user's password]
    F --> I[Access survives password resets]
